      <rules>
        <rule name="Disciple of Sigmar" id="2e11-e3b1-e9cb-116" hidden="false">
          <description>The Cleric has devoted his life in the constant service to Sigmar and as such he would start a campaign knowing one of the Prayers of Sigmar (see Mordheim
rulebook page 57).


As with a Witch-Hunter’s Warrior Priest, he is also subject to some of the restrictions of being a follower of the Lord Sigmar and may learn neither Sorcery nor Arcane Lore..</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
